The pinned Lean binaries are present, but this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` while hiding the numeric PID path that Lean 4.22 uses internally; that makes Lean report “failed to locate application.” I’m applying a narrowly scoped local compatibility shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that only redirects `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the unchanged trusted checker and pinned compiler.
