+
+## Evidence index
+
+Exact commands, rerunnable evidence scripts, command outputs, the preflight
+environment diagnosis, and the compatibility source are under
+`/audit-output/evidence/`; see `evidence/COMMANDS.md`.
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
